FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: Ang costing natin per cubic meter is P70,000.

asr-001190
01:00:38.440 --> 01:00:41.000
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And yung 20 cubic meters po?

asr-001191
01:00:42.120 --> 01:00:44.200
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: That's per cubic meter po.

asr-001192
01:00:44.220 --> 01:00:45.320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Per cubic meter.

asr-001193
01:00:46.460 --> 01:00:52.700
