Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: By the way po, yung coastal areas po, that's yung kilometers po niyan, 43, 43 kilometers point 3.

asr-006229
04:01:38.980 --> 04:01:44.040
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: And roughly, siguro mga 600 to 700 ang population po, residents.

asr-006230
04:01:45.060 --> 04:01:54.240
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Mula po sa Malolos, Hagunoy, Paumbong, Bulacan-Bulacan, Ubando, kasama na po natin yung Kalumpi.

asr-006231
04:01:54.580 --> 04:01:57.860
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Na talagang, ito po talaga yung naapektuhan.

asr-006232
04:01:58.580 --> 04:02:05.580
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: So, ang tingin po namin, yung binabanggit pong paulit-ulit na pinagmamalaki ng SMC,

asr-006233
04:02:06.660 --> 04:02:10.440
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: na hindi sila sanhi, ay hindi po kami naniniwala.

asr-006234
04:02:11.580 --> 04:02:15.340
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Nais namin malaman ng katotohanan sa pamamagitan po ng agham.

asr-006235
04:02:16.160 --> 04:02:23.360
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Ngunit, nagsuriin ng aming mga volunteer, scientist at mga dokumentong isa na publiko ng SMC,

asr-006236
04:02:24.580 --> 04:02:30.020
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Sa kanilang dayuhang konsultan, natuklasan naming itinago ang pinakamahalagang datos.

asr-006237
04:02:31.020 --> 04:02:43.340
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Number one po, ang ipinakita lamang sa publiko at sa gobyerno ay mga istatik o nakalarawang mapa at mga summarized na ulat na pumapabor sa kumpanya.

asr-006238
04:02:43.340 --> 04:02:47.340
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Mga drawing na nagpapakitang walang magiging dagdag na baha.

asr-006239
04:02:47.340 --> 04:03:03.700
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Ipinagkait at hindi sinapubliko ang mismong computer-run files, ang mga mathematical model, ang sukat ng lalim at lapad na mga ilog, river cross sections at mga bataya ng kanilang pagsusuri.

asr-006240
04:03:04.180 --> 04:03:12.760
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Kung walang totoong computer files, hindi masusuri ng mga independenteng siyentipiko mula sa University of the Philippines?

asr-006241
04:03:13.200 --> 04:03:16.180
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Kung totoo ba ang sinasabi ng SMC?

asr-006242
04:03:16.180 --> 04:03:28.520
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: O kung sadyang lulunuri ng kanilang dambuhalang plataporma ang aming mga kabahayan kapag nagsabay ang malakas na bagyo, high tide at pagbabaw ng mga hinukay nilang ilog?

asr-006243
04:03:29.380 --> 04:03:40.480
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Naging malaking pabigat din po, particular, with due respect po sa inyo, sa DNR, na sa halip na protektahan ang kalikasan at mamamayan,

asr-006244
04:03:41.560 --> 04:03:45.320
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: sorry to tell you, naging tagapagtatak na lamang.

asr-006245
04:03:45.320 --> 04:03:55.140
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: ng Environmental Compliance Certificate ng SMC, nang walang masusing pagsusuri at walang bukas na konsultasyon sa mga mamamayan.

asr-006246
04:03:56.220 --> 04:04:14.640
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Hindi pinagana ng Environmental Management Bureau ang kapangyarihan nito sa ilalim ng PD 1586 at DAO 2003-30 upang obligahin ng kumpanya na ilabas ang buong datos at magsagawa ng agarang

asr-006247
04:04:14.640 --> 04:04:16.740
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: ECC Compliance Audit.

asr-006248
04:04:17.560 --> 04:04:39.520
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Hindi rin ginampana ng River Vision Control Office ng DNR ang mandato nito sa ilalim ng Executive Order No. 816 bilang tagapamahala ng pambansang database na mga ilog upang tiyaking ang pagbabago sa mga ilog ng bulakan ay hindi lumalabag sa pangkalatang plano sa flood control.

asr-006249
04:04:39.520 --> 04:04:43.520
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Batay po dito, ang amin pong iminumungkahi.

asr-006250
04:04:44.640 --> 04:04:57.360
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: With due respect po sa chairperson, pag-aralan pong mabuti, linawin ang kondisyon at pananagutan sa pagpapabaya sa bulakan.

asr-006251
04:04:58.480 --> 04:05:02.560
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: As I said po, nagsasabi po ako ng karanasan namin.

asr-006252
04:05:05.140 --> 04:05:14.160
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Pilitin ng DNR na mag-issue ng subpina o pormal na kautusan sa SMC upang isapubliko at ibigay sa mga unibersidad at komunidad.

asr-006253
04:05:14.640 --> 04:05:20.760
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Ang kumpletong raw modeling files at datos ng DHI at Mott MacDonald.

asr-006254
04:05:20.760 --> 04:05:43.260
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: At panghuli po, papanagutin ang SMC sa pinsanang idinulot sa kapuhayan ng mga mangisda at residente at magpatupad ng independenting audit sa pamumunuan ng mga eksperto at mga kinatawan ng mamamayan.

asr-006255
04:05:43.260 --> 04:05:44.560
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: So kami po,

asr-006256
04:05:44.640 --> 04:05:51.080
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: ayaw na po natin sanang narating na naman po yung mga unos, tag-ulan.

asr-006257
04:05:53.520 --> 04:05:55.660
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Ganyan na lang po ang nangyayari sa amin.

asr-006258
04:05:56.300 --> 04:05:59.140
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Hindi po kami naniniwala na kasi high tide.

asr-006259
04:06:00.920 --> 04:06:04.860
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: And hindi naman po makatutuhan ng dahilan lamang po yun.

asr-006260
04:06:05.960 --> 04:06:08.300
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: So kaya naman po natin gawa ng paraan.

asr-006261
04:06:08.300 --> 04:06:14.380
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Kaya po, with due respect sa inyo po at mahal naming senadora,

asr-006262
04:06:14.640 --> 04:06:21.640
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: gusto po naming marinig din po sa DNR ang kanilang mga kasagutan sa amin pong liham na ito.

asr-006263
04:06:24.220 --> 04:06:26.460
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat po, Mr. Aparente.

asr-006264
04:06:26.560 --> 04:06:35.340
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At narinig po ng subcommittee yung, hindi lang yung mga salita, pero yung damdamin at kaisipan din sa inyong liham.

asr-006265
04:06:35.500 --> 04:06:40.060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat po sa pagdalo rito at pagpapahayag niyan.

asr-006266
04:06:40.520 --> 04:06:42.900
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Would you like to respond, Secretary?

asr-006267
04:06:43.220 --> 04:06:44.400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Or at least, could you?

asr-006268
04:06:44.640 --> 04:06:47.560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Respond to them in writing before the plenary debate.

asr-006269
04:06:47.860 --> 04:06:48.660
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Thank you very much.

asr-006270
04:06:48.880 --> 04:06:53.560
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: We will respond comprehensively in writing, Mr. Aparente.

asr-006271
04:06:53.560 --> 04:07:05.280
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Pero offhand, tutulong po kami na kausapin yung proponent regarding yung request for the, yung data po na sinasabi ninyo.

asr-006272
04:07:06.940 --> 04:07:14.560
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Kakusapin po namin kung pwedeng ipabahagi kung anong available na datos na yung hinihingi po ninyo.

asr-006273
04:07:14.640 --> 04:07:15.900
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Para makita ninyong clearly.

asr-006274
04:07:16.100 --> 04:07:19.900
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: I mean, offhand, yun ang, I can assure you, tutulong po kami dyan, Madam Chair.

asr-006275
04:07:20.620 --> 04:07:28.460
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: As far as the ECC issue ones is concerned naman, maybe Director Mike Matias can expound on this.

asr-006276
04:07:28.560 --> 04:07:38.960
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: But offhand, as far as I know, there was a public consultation that was conducted for this.

asr-006277
04:07:38.960 --> 04:07:43.960
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Pero maybe the extent, I really don't know.

asr-006278
04:07:44.640 --> 04:07:46.640
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So, Attorney Mike, meron ba tayong...

asr-006279
04:07:47.320 --> 04:07:48.880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat, Sec. Puna.

asr-006280
04:07:49.380 --> 04:07:56.180
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung dun sa commitment nyo na tutulong kayong kausapin yung proponent para maibahagi yung datos.

asr-006281
04:07:56.360 --> 04:08:03.940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: In particular, binanggit ni Mr. Aparente yung computer-run files, yung mathematical models, at dalawa pang items.

asr-006282
04:08:04.440 --> 04:08:07.940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yes, Director Matias, meron ba kayong brief na response?

asr-006283
04:08:08.180 --> 04:08:13.200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And or could you also respond to Bulacan Alliance for Reform in Writing?

asr-006284
04:08:14.020 --> 04:08:14.620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you.

asr-006285
04:08:14.640 --> 04:08:16.040
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Thank you, Madam Senator and Sir.

asr-006286
04:08:17.740 --> 04:08:24.720
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Based on the EIA process, it went through the scoping and the public participation, which is a requirement.

asr-006287
04:08:25.180 --> 04:08:32.360
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: And given yung request, we'll coordinate with the release of the information.

asr-006288
04:08:32.360 --> 04:08:43.280
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Kasi, Madam Senator, I think naka-anchor yung way forward dun sa information being asked by Sir Aparente.

asr-006289
04:08:44.640 --> 04:08:46.240
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat, Director Matias.

asr-006290
04:08:46.400 --> 04:09:02.800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Hopefully, maging opening po yan, kabukasan po yan para makarating sa isang maayos na sagot dun sa tanong nila, Mr. Aparente, na paanong magagawang paraan dito sa sitwasyong ito.

asr-006291
04:09:03.580 --> 04:09:05.260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat po muli, Mr. Aparente.

asr-006292
04:09:06.180 --> 04:09:14.320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mag-keep in touch po tayo sa subcommittee, papunta po sa budget plenaries para sa iba nyo pang follow-up questions.

asr-006293
04:09:14.640 --> 04:09:22.140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At maaring mga proposed amendments for the consideration ng subcommittee in partnership sa department.

asr-006294
04:09:22.840 --> 04:09:23.760
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Maraming salamat.

asr-006295
04:09:23.940 --> 04:09:24.840
Bulacan Alliance for Reform Representative Avelino P. Aparente: Salamat din po.

asr-006296
04:09:25.340 --> 04:09:30.540
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Any other brief highlights na gusto nyong ibahagi from Civil Society?

asr-006297
04:09:31.580 --> 04:09:34.380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mr. A.J. Montesa sa People's Budget Coalition.

asr-006298
04:09:34.940 --> 04:09:36.560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Yes. Maraming salamat po.

asr-006299
04:09:36.660 --> 04:09:41.980
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Good afternoon, Madam Chair, Senator Hontiveros, DNR officials, and to our colleagues from Civil Society.

asr-006300
04:09:42.220 --> 04:09:44.580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: On behalf of the People's Budget Coalition,

asr-006301
04:09:44.640 --> 04:09:50.720
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Ken Amante and myself, I would like to thank you, Sen. Teresa, for inviting us as resource persons.

asr-006302
04:09:51.200 --> 04:09:53.820
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: I think we do need to acknowledge that this is a huge step.

asr-006303
04:09:54.300 --> 04:10:00.160
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: This is the first time that civil society is being invited to a department budget hearing in at least 10 years.

asr-006304
04:10:00.540 --> 04:10:11.500
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So we really do acknowledge how important this proceeding is for us and for restoring trust in the entire budget process after the damage that was done in the previous scandals.

asr-006305
04:10:11.940 --> 04:10:14.620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: For the DNR budget, we believe that there is no shortage.

asr-006306
04:10:14.620 --> 04:10:16.200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: There is no such thing as a natural disaster.

asr-006307
04:10:16.700 --> 04:10:17.980
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: All disasters are man-made.

asr-006308
04:10:18.840 --> 04:10:24.200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Failures in planning, coordination, enforcement, and watershed protection make things worse.

asr-006309
04:10:24.720 --> 04:10:32.340
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: And the flood control scandal of the last years showed billions of pesos spent on infrastructure while communities remain dangerously vulnerable.

asr-006310
04:10:33.220 --> 04:10:34.480
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So we look to the DNR.

asr-006311
04:10:34.480 --> 04:10:41.960
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: We expect an agency that will protect our watersheds, enforce environmental laws, scrutinize development projects,

asr-006312
04:10:42.140 --> 04:10:44.480
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: and ensure that government investments do not aggravate

asr-006313
04:10:44.620 --> 04:10:59.100
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: the very disasters that they are supposed to prevent. Our assessment is that the current version of the DNR budget will not adequately prepare us for typhoons, flooding, urban heat, and the extreme weather conditions worsened by the strong El Nino.

asr-006314
04:10:59.800 --> 04:11:05.820
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: The budget of the DNR Office of the Secretary has been stuck at 16 to 20 billion pesos since 2018.

asr-006315
04:11:05.820 --> 04:11:12.920
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: And accounting for inflation over the last 10 years, and even the recent depreciation of the peso and oil price hikes,

asr-006316
04:11:13.240 --> 04:11:14.600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: this means that the real budget...

asr-006317
04:11:14.620 --> 04:11:18.300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: of the department has fallen by about 30% in real terms.

asr-006318
04:11:18.980 --> 04:11:24.180
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Capital outlays fell from 37% in 2018 to just 12% for this coming year.

asr-006319
04:11:24.680 --> 04:11:28.800
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: And 1.8 billion pesos was left unobligated in 2025.

asr-006320
04:11:29.620 --> 04:11:33.580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: In the 2027 proposal, the Environmental Management Bureau, or EMB,

asr-006321
04:11:33.880 --> 04:11:36.660
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: which issues and monitors environmental compliance certificates,

asr-006322
04:11:37.140 --> 04:11:41.640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: is the only attached bureau that was cut or reduced by 360 million pesos.

asr-006323
04:11:41.640 --> 04:11:43.640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So we want a stronger DNR that...

asr-006324
04:11:44.620 --> 04:11:47.700
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: enforces our environmental laws to prevent these disasters.

asr-006325
04:11:48.400 --> 04:11:52.280
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: But a bigger budget will not necessarily make communities safer

asr-006326
04:11:52.280 --> 04:11:57.560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: if the DNR keeps approving projects without studying these projects comprehensively.

asr-006327
04:11:58.240 --> 04:12:01.300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: To be frank, our civil society movements are very concerned

asr-006328
04:12:01.300 --> 04:12:07.880
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: that DNR too often acts as a rubber stamp in its environmental impact assessment procedures.

asr-006329
04:12:08.500 --> 04:12:12.680
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Feedback on the ground has been that the department proposes certifications and approvals

asr-006330
04:12:12.680 --> 04:12:14.600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: without sufficiently accounting for the impact of the environmental impact.

asr-006331
04:12:14.620 --> 04:12:22.800
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So we need an agency that anticipates harm and not just one that merely responds

asr-006332
04:12:22.800 --> 04:12:24.640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: after the damage has already been done.

asr-006333
04:12:25.520 --> 04:12:28.400
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So we illustrate three systemic issues using three cases.

asr-006334
04:12:29.160 --> 04:12:30.620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: First, the environmental...

asr-006335
04:12:30.620 --> 04:12:32.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Briefly na lang, yung tatlo.

asr-006336
04:12:33.080 --> 04:12:36.880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Either enumerate the three or detail one, please.

asr-006337
04:12:37.080 --> 04:12:37.420
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Thank you.

asr-006338
04:12:37.760 --> 04:12:42.300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: The first one is the environmental clearance of expressway projects,

asr-006339
04:12:42.300 --> 04:12:43.600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: especially the SALEX,

asr-006340
04:12:43.600 --> 04:12:49.300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: which is San Miguel's 40.65-kilometer Southern Access Link Expressway

asr-006341
04:12:49.300 --> 04:12:55.220
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: na sasagasa sa mga puno, kalikasan, paaralan, ospital, negosyo at heritage

asr-006342
04:12:55.220 --> 04:13:00.800
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: sa Quirina Rojas Boulevard, Padre Faura, Buendia, C3R10, and Shoreline Expressway.

asr-006343
04:13:01.740 --> 04:13:06.560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: The different civil society movements like Stop SALEX and Ilog Pasiglahin movements

asr-006344
04:13:06.560 --> 04:13:09.940
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: have pointed out the bad impacts of elevated expressways

asr-006345
04:13:09.940 --> 04:13:13.500
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: on health, traffic, heritage, environment, and economy.

asr-006346
04:13:13.600 --> 04:13:17.620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So we ask, why is the DENR approving elevated expressways

asr-006347
04:13:17.620 --> 04:13:21.640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: even when the most progressive cities in the world are tearing them down?

asr-006348
04:13:22.160 --> 04:13:26.260
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So ang tanong po namin, why did the construction of a 40-kilometer expressway

asr-006349
04:13:26.260 --> 04:13:29.100
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: proceed without a full environmental impact assessment?

asr-006350
04:13:29.700 --> 04:13:34.380
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Why did it proceed with only three initial environmental examination checklists

asr-006351
04:13:34.380 --> 04:13:36.660
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: covering a total of only 13 kilometers?

asr-006352
04:13:37.280 --> 04:13:42.180
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: I think for the other two issues, I think my colleague Ken will just briefly touch on them po.

asr-006353
04:13:42.180 --> 04:13:43.520
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you.

asr-006354
04:13:43.600 --> 04:13:47.880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: AJ, yes, Ken Abante from People's Budget Coalition. Briefly, please.

asr-006355
04:13:47.960 --> 04:13:49.120
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Maraming salamat po, Sen. Teresa.

asr-006356
04:13:49.300 --> 04:13:53.380
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Yung pangalawang karanasan po na gusto namin i-share ay sa tingin po namin napakahalaga

asr-006357
04:13:53.380 --> 04:13:55.880
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: para po sa preparation natin sa El Ni?o at pagbaha.

asr-006358
04:13:56.300 --> 04:13:59.420
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ito po yung karanasan sa sistema ng watershed restoration.

asr-006359
04:14:00.100 --> 04:14:05.140
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Yung Upper Marikina Basin Protected Landscape covering 26,000 hectares in Rizal

asr-006360
04:14:05.140 --> 04:14:09.580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: ay protection po natin sa matinding pagbaha at tagtuyot sa buong Kamainilaan.

asr-006361
04:14:09.580 --> 04:14:13.580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Pero po, despite its protected status, the watershed remains severely

asr-006362
04:14:13.600 --> 04:14:14.500
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: degraded.

asr-006363
04:14:14.840 --> 04:14:22.840
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Yung forest cover po nito ay 25% na lamang against DENR's restoration target of 43% by 2028,

asr-006364
04:14:23.080 --> 04:14:25.060
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: which we believe to still be too low.

asr-006365
04:14:25.680 --> 04:14:30.480
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Dapat 72% to 90% ayon sa isang 2018 World Bank DENR study.

asr-006366
04:14:30.980 --> 04:14:36.380
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: The higher the forest cover, the greater the water and disaster resilience benefits versus river runoffs.

asr-006367
04:14:36.380 --> 04:14:43.380
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ang status po ng restoration, 1,500 of these 26,000 hectares are in danger of incursion

asr-006368
04:14:43.600 --> 04:14:48.320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: 2 major projects need urgent review and finalization by the DENR.

asr-006369
04:14:48.760 --> 04:14:52.320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ang una, si Rapid City at sister company nitong Quarry Rock

asr-006370
04:14:52.320 --> 04:14:56.620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: ay may quarrying projects na kinansinalanan ng DENR noong 2022.

asr-006371
04:14:56.760 --> 04:14:58.040
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Maraming salamat po DENR.

asr-006372
04:14:58.440 --> 04:15:00.080
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Pero hindi pa rin po finalized ang desisyon

asr-006373
04:15:00.000 --> 04:15:06.320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: sa kanilang motion for consideration, which potentially impacts 985 hectares.

asr-006374
04:15:06.680 --> 04:15:10.720
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ang pangalawang proyekto po ay ang VINA Energy na may application naman

asr-006375
04:15:10.720 --> 04:15:16.300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: para sa isang 553 hectares na special use agreement in protected areas or SAPA

asr-006376
04:15:16.300 --> 04:15:18.260
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: at pending pa rin po ito sa DNR.

asr-006377
04:15:18.700 --> 04:15:22.600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: At may formal opposition na po dito ang Upper Marikina Watershed.

asr-006378
04:15:23.220 --> 04:15:26.780
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So we hope, isa lang pong kaso ang Upper Marikina Watershed.

asr-006379
04:15:26.780 --> 04:15:30.800
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We think this has to be one of the core issues that are discussed by the committee

asr-006380
04:15:30.800 --> 04:15:36.160
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: and also in the plenary because we want prevention, not just damage control.

asr-006381
04:15:36.820 --> 04:15:41.140
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And we also ask DNR to account for all the other watersheds in the country

asr-006382
04:15:41.140 --> 04:15:45.340
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: because we are hearing from different civil society groups that this is also the case.

asr-006383
04:15:45.840 --> 04:15:50.940
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And finally po, we think that DNR has a responsibility to also stop the flood control scandal.

asr-006384
04:15:50.940 --> 04:15:56.520
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ayon po sa isang Action Klima Report, only 0.1% of the national budget

asr-006385
04:15:56.520 --> 04:15:59.340
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: is spent on nature-based solutions.

asr-006386
04:15:59.560 --> 04:16:04.560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Karamihan po nang natag sa climate budget ay puro mga DPWH gray infrastructure.

asr-006387
04:16:05.100 --> 04:16:12.680
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So we ask the DENR to please help us review the 7,054 projects worth 190 billion pesos

asr-006388
04:16:12.680 --> 04:16:17.620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: that we tagged were inserted by the House of Representatives without proper documentation.

asr-006389
04:16:18.760 --> 04:16:21.000
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We ask for the Senate's help on this.

asr-006390
04:16:21.220 --> 04:16:23.240
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We have the list. We have the maps.

asr-006391
04:16:23.840 --> 04:16:26.500
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We are seeing many projects in many different areas.

asr-006392
04:16:27.120 --> 04:16:30.320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: That were inserted by the House without proper documentation.

asr-006393
04:16:30.900 --> 04:16:35.500
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Please DNR, please help us make sure that these projects are proper.

asr-006394
04:16:36.400 --> 04:16:42.900
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And just to summarize po, we hope that the committee supports us in the review of these expressway projects

asr-006395
04:16:42.900 --> 04:16:46.740
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: and the incursions in the Upper Marikina Watershed and other watersheds

asr-006396
04:16:46.740 --> 04:16:52.320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: to publish the status and work with us on verifying all of these maps

asr-006397
04:16:52.460 --> 04:16:56.340
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: and making sure that the scientific community is really part of the process,

asr-006398
04:16:56.520 --> 04:16:58.160
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: of approving the projects.

asr-006399
04:16:58.360 --> 04:16:59.120
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We are with you.

asr-006400
04:16:59.760 --> 04:17:01.900
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Hindi na po natutulog ang aming mga angry nerds.

asr-006401
04:17:01.900 --> 04:17:07.200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So pag-check po ng 18,000 projects that were passed by the House.

asr-006402
04:17:07.700 --> 04:17:10.920
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And we are committed, Senator Riza and Secretary Cuna,

asr-006403
04:17:11.180 --> 04:17:14.520
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: to work with you on guarding our public money.

asr-006404
04:17:16.700 --> 04:17:17.740
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Thank you.

asr-006405
04:17:18.580 --> 04:17:21.920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ken Abante also from the People's Budget Coalition.

asr-006406
04:17:22.840 --> 04:17:24.780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: The subcommittee hears you too.

asr-006407
04:17:25.920 --> 04:17:26.400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And...

asr-006410
04:17:26.520 --> 04:17:34.080
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Very well noted yung mga initial na follow-up questions or points that you have raised.

asr-006411
04:17:34.600 --> 04:17:37.060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And gaya ng sinabi ko rin kay Mr. Aparente,

asr-006412
04:17:37.600 --> 04:17:41.200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: asahan po namin ang subcommittee in partnership sa DNR

asr-006413
04:17:41.200 --> 04:17:46.280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: yung patuloy niyong engage sa amin papunta sa plenary.

asr-006414
04:17:46.920 --> 04:17:52.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Both for additional questions tulad ng dinagdag niyo ngayong hapon

asr-006415
04:17:52.860 --> 04:17:56.400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at saka possible proposed amendments.

asr-006416
04:17:56.400 --> 04:18:00.720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I think very exciting yung possibilities dito.

asr-006417
04:18:00.880 --> 04:18:02.960
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So let's do our best.

asr-006418
04:18:03.640 --> 04:18:14.640
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So I would like to thank, marami salamat po ang DNR at ang attached agency sa pagpresenta nyo ng budget para sa 2027.

asr-006419
04:18:15.680 --> 04:18:25.360
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Important issues ang nag-surface kasama na yung kakulangan ng paghahanda natin sa dumating na at tumitindi pang Super El Nino.

asr-006420
04:18:25.360 --> 04:18:25.560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So...

asr-006421
04:18:25.560 --> 04:18:26.280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So...

asr-006422
04:18:26.280 --> 04:18:31.560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Asahan po ninyo na makikipagrabaho ang subcommittee sa department

asr-006423
04:18:31.560 --> 04:18:39.720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at saka sa finance committee chair para i-transform yung DNR budget sa isang El Nino ready budget

asr-006424
04:18:39.720 --> 04:18:44.560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: para ma-mitigate yung negatibong epekto sa ating kalikasan at sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-006425
04:18:45.400 --> 04:18:45.660
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Senator?

asr-006426
04:18:46.160 --> 04:18:46.540
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yes.

asr-006427
04:18:46.700 --> 04:18:48.560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ay ma'am, sorry. There was another...

asr-006428
04:18:49.400 --> 04:18:49.660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Hala!

asr-006429
04:18:51.160 --> 04:18:54.260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: You should have said so earlier. That's what your mic is for.

asr-006430
04:18:54.340 --> 04:18:54.800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you.

asr-006431
04:18:55.040 --> 04:18:55.720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you again.

asr-006432
04:18:55.720 --> 04:18:56.160
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Okay.

asr-006433
04:18:56.160 --> 04:19:00.320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Briefly na lang please, Ms. Eunice of the Mangrove Breakthrough.

asr-006434
04:19:00.960 --> 04:19:02.140
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: Mangrove Breakthrough.

asr-006435
04:19:02.480 --> 04:19:03.320
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: Yes. Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-006436
04:19:03.320 --> 04:19:03.960
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Two minutes please.

asr-006437
04:19:04.100 --> 04:19:04.700
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: Very briefly.

asr-006438
04:19:05.100 --> 04:19:10.220
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: So I think our colleagues at the PBC have already talked about the upstream issues on watershed management.

asr-006439
04:19:10.360 --> 04:19:13.580
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: I'd like to focus on downstream to coastal communities.

asr-006440
04:19:14.260 --> 04:19:15.320
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: So I'm Eunice Tanilon.

asr-006441
04:19:15.500 --> 04:19:19.000
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: Thank you so much to the subcommittee, Secretary Kuna, and our colleagues from DNR.

asr-006442
04:19:19.460 --> 04:19:24.760
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: I'm Eunice Tanilon of the Mangrove Breakthrough, a global partnership of government, scientists, and investors

asr-006443
04:19:24.760 --> 04:19:27.960
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: working to secure the world's mangroves by 2030.

asr-006444
04:19:28.340 --> 04:19:35.200
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: Our partner is the Global Mangrove Alliance Philippines, comprised of key conservation organizations.

asr-006445
04:19:35.980 --> 04:19:39.960
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: We work together with the DNR and the National Blue Carbon Action Partnership.

asr-006446
04:19:39.960 --> 04:19:48.940
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: So it's essentially a roadmap for five years on how to restore our key mangrove priority landscapes.

asr-006447
04:19:49.720 --> 04:19:52.960
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: So I think what I want to talk about this afternoon is to really just...

asr-006448
04:19:52.960 --> 04:20:01.960
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: how difficult it's been to put together financing and money for the very large-scale coordination that's needed

asr-006449
04:20:01.960 --> 04:20:05.260
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: to support restoration projects.

asr-006450
04:20:05.920 --> 04:20:07.220
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ms. Eunice, briefly please.

asr-006451
04:20:07.440 --> 04:20:10.200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kasi may pagkakataon pa tayo na mag-usap at makipagtrabaho.

asr-006452
04:20:10.820 --> 04:20:12.060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Please proceed.

asr-006453
04:20:12.240 --> 04:20:13.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: But please wind up.

asr-006454
04:20:13.180 --> 04:20:19.040
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: I think to jump straight to our recommendations, we really hope that the DNR could fund,

asr-006455
04:20:19.040 --> 04:20:22.160
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: and of course the committee could fund the foundations,

asr-006456
04:20:22.160 --> 04:20:23.660
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: and put a date on protocol.

asr-006457
04:20:23.660 --> 04:20:28.660
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: So we would really like a national carbon stock assessment carried out with our universities,

asr-006458
04:20:28.660 --> 04:20:30.660
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: funded through the research lines,

asr-006459
04:20:30.660 --> 04:20:36.660
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: and a commitment that a blue carbon quantification protocol will be issued as a department order

asr-006460
04:20:36.660 --> 04:20:39.160
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: by the end of the first quarter of 2027.

asr-006461
04:20:39.160 --> 04:20:45.160
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: This has been the key item that's been blocking all of our conversations with investors.

asr-006462
04:20:45.160 --> 04:20:51.160
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: We've been in conversations with ADB, AIIB, and also other banks in Singapore.

asr-006463
04:20:51.160 --> 04:20:52.080
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: And a lot of...

asr-006464
04:20:52.080 --> 04:20:56.580
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: a lot of our conversations stalled because of the lack of these foundational items.

asr-006465
04:20:56.580 --> 04:21:02.080
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: And secondly, we hope that a special provision in the DNR budget that accounts for blue carbon

asr-006466
04:21:02.080 --> 04:21:08.080
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: separately from forest carbon requires the department to designate within 90 days

asr-006467
04:21:08.080 --> 04:21:12.080
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: the bureau accountable for mangroves inside and outside protected areas

asr-006468
04:21:12.080 --> 04:21:17.580
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: and requires an annual public hectare count against the PSA mangrove accounts.

asr-006469
04:21:17.580 --> 04:21:21.580
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: So we really hope with this that it gives every loan, grant, and private peso

asr-006470
04:21:21.580 --> 04:21:24.580
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: a public share to match against.

asr-006471
04:21:24.580 --> 04:21:29.580
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: So we're very willing to help the Mangrove Breakthrough and Global Mangrove Alliance on these items.

asr-006472
04:21:29.580 --> 04:21:31.580
Makati Business Club Governance and Sustainability Lead Eunice Tanilon: Thank you very much.

asr-006473
04:21:31.580 --> 04:21:36.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you very much too, Mangrove Breakthrough.

asr-006474
04:21:36.580 --> 04:21:42.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung blue carbon niyo very interesting kasi dinidinig nga namin yung blue economy bill

asr-006475
04:21:42.580 --> 04:21:44.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: sa Committee on Economic Affairs.

asr-006476
04:21:44.580 --> 04:21:49.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And special provision, we love special provisions in the budget.

asr-006477
04:21:49.580 --> 04:21:50.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: What is that?

asr-006478
04:21:51.580 --> 04:21:56.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Platform towards making them regular line items in the following year's budget.

asr-006479
04:21:56.580 --> 04:21:59.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, salamat, salamat sa inyo.

asr-006480
04:21:59.580 --> 04:22:04.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I really share the excitement to, sabi ko nga kay SEC nung briefings namin,

asr-006481
04:22:04.580 --> 04:22:09.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: to raise the profile of the department strategically in the years ahead.

asr-006482
04:22:09.580 --> 04:22:14.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Starting, continuing now, especially dito sa panahon ng Super El Nino.

asr-006483
04:22:14.580 --> 04:22:20.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And for the department to have more naman than 1% of the budget.

asr-006484
04:22:21.580 --> 04:22:29.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: 0.1, oh my God, okay, 0.1% of the budget and to spend it optimally.

asr-006485
04:22:29.580 --> 04:22:35.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Anyway, so to continue, I was just going to close our hearing for today.

asr-006486
04:22:35.580 --> 04:22:42.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So yun, seryoso yung i-consider din namin yung inputs mula sa CSO partners

asr-006487
04:22:42.580 --> 04:22:45.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: sa transformation ito ng DNR budget.

asr-006488
04:22:45.580 --> 04:22:50.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, sa ganyan, gusto kong formal na i-endorse yung budget ng DNR sa plenary.

asr-006489
04:22:51.580 --> 04:22:55.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Suspended yung hearing natin. Maraming salamat po mga kasama.

asr-006490
04:22:55.580 --> 04:22:58.580
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Thank you very much Madam Chair. Thank you very much.

